Q2. Write a python program to check whether a given URL is valid or not

[20 Marks]

# Q2 Alternative Solution

import re

url = input("Enter URL: ")

# Regular expression for URL validation
pattern = r'^(https?:\/\/)?(www\.)?[a-zA-Z0-9\-]+\.[a-zA-Z]{2,}'

if re.match(pattern, url):
    print("Valid URL")
else:
    print("Invalid URL")


